    title: "BloodHound: view AD graph, find path to Domain Admin",
    description:
      `Stand up BloodHound Community Edition, load SpecterOps' official sample Active Directory dataset, and use the built-in Cypher-backed queries to find the shortest attack path to Domain Admin. This is the single most important AD attack-path tool in real engagements — reading a BloodHound graph correctly is what turns 'we have local admin on one box' into 'we own the domain'.`,
