    description:
      `Analyse a real, publicly-published malware PCAP from malware-traffic-analysis.net to find the C2 beacon's destination, interval, and payload signature. Real beacons look nothing like a Hollywood hacking scene — this lab teaches the actual blue-team skill of spotting a suspiciously regular pattern buried in otherwise-normal traffic.`,
    platform: "Wireshark",
    difficulty: "medium",
